  <item>
    <title>“月入八百”背后的坚持，多伦多脱口秀演员Steven与花生喜剧的成长故事</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67da57c4dd11f9c8c19cc90f</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">67da57c4dd11f9c8c19cc90f</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 19 Mar 2025 15:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期节目，我邀请到了</span><strong><span>我最喜欢的多伦多脱口秀演员——Steven</span></strong><span>，他不仅是多伦多</span><strong><span>花生喜剧的主理人</span></strong><span>，也是一名程序员。在代码与笑声之间，他找到了独特的舞台，并不断推动多伦多华语喜剧的发展。</span></p><span></span><p><span>我们聊到了他在</span><strong><span>2020年初次接触脱口秀</span></strong><span>，到如今带领花生喜剧一路成长的故事。他分享了如何在坚持做喜剧的过程中找到成就感，以及多伦多脱口秀演员的多元背景。Steven还深入讲解了他的</span><strong><span>第一个主打秀《月入八百》</span></strong><span>，这是一场基于他程序员求职与奋斗经历的爆笑演出，真实又幽默。</span></p><span></span><p><span>最后，我们一起展望了</span><strong><span>花生喜剧的未来发展</span></strong><span>，包括主打秀、精品秀、即兴喜剧等新计划。</span></p><span></span><p><span>无论你是喜剧爱好者，还是想尝试开放麦的新人，这期节目都值得一听！快来一起感受笑声的魅力吧！</span></p><span></span><p><span>🎙 </span><strong><span>节目时间线</span></strong><br><span> </span><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="100">01:40</a></span></strong><span> | 2020年初次接触脱口秀，花生喜剧的成长之路</span><br><span> </span><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="360">06:00</a></span></strong><span> | 坚持做喜剧的动力与成就感</span><br><span> </span><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="690">11:30</a></span></strong><span> | 多伦多脱口秀演员的多元背景</span><br><span> </span><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="960">16:00</a></span></strong><span> | </span><strong><span>Steven的第一个主打秀《月入八百》</span></strong><span>——程序员求职奋斗的爆笑故事</span><br><span> </span><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1140">19:00</a></span></strong><span> | </span><strong><span>如何准备开放麦？新手指南</span></strong><br><span> </span><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1350">22:30</a></span></strong><span> | </span><strong><span>段子是怎么炼成的？</span></strong><br><span> </span><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1650">27:30</a></span></strong><span> | 不止是舞台，脱口秀改变生活</span><br><span> </span><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1980">33:00</a></span></strong><span> | </span><strong><span>花生喜剧未来的规划</span></strong><span>——主打秀、精品秀、即兴喜剧</span></p><span></span><p><span>主播：波尔多斯、Ben</span></p>]]></description>
